; range/sort/filter/some/every
0 5 range len print
0 5 range 3 get print
list 3 push 1 push 2 push sort 0 get print
0 10 range 'even filter len print
0 10 range 'big some print
0 10 range 'big every print
; orelse
0 42 orelse print
7 42 orelse print
; group/agg/unique/flat/chunk
0 10 range 'pmod group g!
g@ 0 get len print
g@ 'gsum agg a!
a@ 1 get print
list 1 push 2 push 2 push 3 push 1 push unique len print
list list 1 push 2 push push list 3 push push 4 push flat len print
0 7 range 3 chunk len print
0 7 range 3 chunk 2 get len print
ret
; --- quotation bodies ---
even: 2 rem 0 eq ret
big: 5 gt ret
pmod: 3 rem ret
gsum: lst! lst@ len n! n@ _arr int a! n@ 'cp for a@ vsum ret
cp: k! lst@ k@ get v! a@ k@ v@ set ret
